枢机构","official_name":"丞相長史","official_note":"丞相長史是丞相的属官，负责协助处理政务，在汉代属于高级官员。在上下文中，被派遣参与镇压叛乱，体现了中央政府的军事指挥职能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"遣丞相長史、御史中丞逐捕","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"de6e53de-91a9-40de-915e-811818df09d2"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史中丞","official_note":"御史中丞是御史大夫的属官，负责监察百官，在汉代属于重要监察官员。在上下文中，被派遣参与镇压叛乱，可能涉及监督执法或军事行动。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"遣丞相長史、御史中丞逐捕","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"dd632af1-271d-43b3-bec7-cb8ff92c141d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-99,"link_death_year":-22,"link_td_description":"申屠圣，西汉铁官徒起义首领，颍川郡（今河南禹州市）人。","link_td_id":"Q10019684","link_td_number_id":5981904,"people_name":"申屠聖","people_name_jianti_auto":"申屠圣","people_xingming":"申屠圣","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"91e568be-db0e-11ef-98fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","resolved_place_entity_id":910,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"91e568bf-db0e-11ef-88dc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2夏，六月，潁川鐵官徒申屠聖等百八十人殺長吏，盜庫兵，自稱將軍，經歷九郡。遣丞相長史、御史中丞逐捕，以軍興從事，皆伏辜。","content_fanyi":"夏季六月，颍川铁官的刑徒申屠圣等一百八十人杀死长吏，盗取武库兵器，自称将军反叛，辗转经过九个郡。汉成帝派遣丞相长史、御史中丞追捕，依照战时调集军队的规定行事，申屠圣等全部伏法。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，六月，颍川铁官徒申屠圣等百八十人杀长吏，盗库兵，自称将军，经历九郡。遣丞相长史、御史中丞逐捕，以军兴从事，皆伏辜。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2418,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"91e568bb-db0e-11ef-9af6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"临终前推荐继任者","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_91E568C0DB0E11EF9A61A0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"是否接受特进并领城门兵之职","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_91E568C0DB0E11EF9A61A0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtR